decision 180, decision 37: a define record has no representation in a baked go emit, so check reports it there, matching what build would refuse.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A rule.
record Rule {
  /// A define.
  it: Define
}

/// The rule.
let rule: Rule = { it: { value: 3 } }

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8012]  a/a.canon:6:3
  Rule.it cannot be emitted: Define has no representation in generated code

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
